translations.だって、泳げなくても生きていけるでしょ？:
But it's not like I can't live
if I don't know how to swim,
isn't it？

translations.確かにそうだけど、スポーツとは違うでしょ？:
True, but that's different
from playing a sport,
right？

translations.あのね、あなたのために聞いたんだけど……ううん、なんでもない……。:
You know, I only asked
for your sake... No,
never mind...

translations.飲んだら飲むな、飲まれるな、バリウム。:
If you drink, don't drink;
don't let it drink you...
barium.

translations.（先生まで……▲姉ヶ崎＊▲ばっかり頼らないで欲しいよな……）:
(Even the teachers... I wish
they wouldn't lean on ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲
for everything...)

translations.へえ、そっか。じゃあ、もし大荷物になったら、呼び出してくれよ。:
Oh, gotcha. Well, if you
end up with heavy bags,
give me a call, okay？

translations.会える時間が短いぶん、ギュッと中味が詰まったデートにしようね？:
Since we don't have much time,
let's make every second count,
okay？

translations.……うん。じゃあ、今日のところはあきらめる。また今度ね。:
...Okay. I'll give up
for today, then. Next time,
alright？

translations.あなたも、何か悩んでることあったら、忘れちゃお？:
If anything's bothering you,
let's just forget about it,
okay？

translations.たまには私がエスコートしてあげようか……。もう、冗談だからね？:
Maybe I should take the lead 
for once... Oh, come on, 
I'm just teasing, okay？

translations.そういえば、▲姉ヶ崎＊▲がメールで、宿題やってるか確認するって言ってたな……:
(Come to think of it, ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲
said she'd text me to check
if I did my homework...)

translations.１週間続けてくれたね、おやすみメール。:
You kept it up
for a whole week,
those good-night texts.

translations.（あれ……建物ずっと眺めてる人がいる……）:
(Huh... Someone's been 
staring at the building 
for a while...)

translations.（そう言えば、このベッド……\nやっぱり、\n一つずつ使うわけだよな？）:
(Come to think of it, these
beds... I guess we're each
using our own, right？)

translations.（弁天様か……\n大丈夫だよな、\n●と▲姉ヶ崎＊▲なら！）:
(Benten-sama, huh...
We'll be fine,
if it's ● and ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲!)

translations.付き合ってる子達は、\n自由時間にデートしちゃったり\nするんだって。:
...and couples sneak off
for dates during free time,
or so I've heard.

translations.（やったっ!!\n●と▲姉ヶ崎＊▲、\nハネムーンごっこだっ！）:
(All right!!
A pretend honeymoon
for ● and ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲!)

translations.だって、頑張りすぎて\n倒れちゃったら\n元も子もないし……。:
I mean, if you collapse
from pushing yourself,
what was the point...？

translations.ふふっ、\n将来の予行演習だと思って、\nいまから勉強ね。:
Hehe. Think of it as practice
for our future,
so time to start studying up.
